    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/2c393afe3275a2999511dd10e0a62ca7.poster.avif?t=1720569085\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/2c393afe3275a2999511dd10e0a62ca7.webm?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/2c393afe3275a2999511dd10e0a62ca7.mp4?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into the unknown as a Void Scavenger. With your crew, or by yourself, you'll explore the vast, cold reaches of space. Using your Terminal, you'll scan for nearby space stations to land on and scavenge. Each mission will lead you to eerie, procedurally generated space stations each with its own sinister secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/b90e6e717937e7afbfb4ec2ceedc7833.poster.avif?t=1720569085\" width=600 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/b90e6e717937e7afbfb4ec2ceedc7833.webm?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/b90e6e717937e7afbfb4ec2ceedc7833.mp4?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/4787ffd594381b02440242e6babf2d10.poster.avif?t=1720569085\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/4787ffd594381b02440242e6babf2d10.webm?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/4787ffd594381b02440242e6babf2d10.mp4?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive into shadowy realms teeming with nightmarish creatures. Gather valuable items to convert into raw materials, your essential currency for updating your gear and unlocking exclusive upgrades. As you progress, you'll improve your equipment and abilities, gearing up for the horrors that await.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/4fc6a5e05aee1b5ee53809638ec48f59.poster.avif?t=1720569085\" width=600 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/4fc6a5e05aee1b5ee53809638ec48f59.webm?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/4fc6a5e05aee1b5ee53809638ec48f59.mp4?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/e3af2084777a3e4b0af2bb86af4ce3b7.poster.avif?t=1720569085\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/e3af2084777a3e4b0af2bb86af4ce3b7.webm?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021640/extras/e3af2084777a3e4b0af2bb86af4ce3b7.mp4?t=1720569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As a Void Scavenger, every decision is a gamble, and every step could be your last. Dark corners conceal unspeakable secrets, and each mission tests your sanity. Can you and your crew survive the unseen terrors and return to your ship with your hard-earned loot? Dare to step into the abyss and find out.",
